  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "t001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# BIOMETRIC ATTENDANCE LAB — facility map\nEnter at the CENTRAL HUB, open a room, follow the arrows, come back. Colour = area. Read [[08 - Documentation Library/Documentation Library]] for the legend.",
      "x": -1340,
      "y": -1180,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "#1d3557",
      "textSize": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "t002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## CENTRAL HUB\n\n[[00 - Vault Hub]]\n\nIdentity · status · blockers · navigation\n\n**R307S = UNVERIFIED**\nBuild pass ≠ hardware pass",
