    {
      "id": "t013",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ⚠ EVIDENCE GATE\n**[VERIFIED]** evidence observed\n**[UNVERIFIED]** mapped, not measured\n**[NOT EXECUTED]** never run\n**[BLOCKED]** prerequisite missing\n**[BUILD PASS]** compiles only",
